Edger is a modified fork of Ledger.

Original work by Potatoboy9999, QuiltServerTools, and Ledger contributors.
Syrup Studios modified the fork on 2026-10-15. Changes include the Edger name
and the net.syrupstudios.edger package.

Edger uses the `edger` mod ID. The original authors and copyright
notices remain in place. The project is licensed under LGPL-3.0. Copies of
the LGPL-3.0 and GPL-3.0 license texts accompany the source and binary jars.
